{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前亲近的日子，曾盼着还能那样相处，但旧日的委屈又让他反复怀疑当初的选择。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、委屈、后悔、纠结\",\n      \"missed\": \"熟悉的主题唤回亲密、感激和短暂幸福的具体感受；下方音符像急促脚步和乱拍心跳，以及脑中反复出现的如果当时、是不是还可以等念头，都需要读小字才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他怀念过去的亲近，却在回忆中重新碰到当初的委屈，开始反复追问那一步是否走对了。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、委屈、遗憾、犹豫、焦躁\",\n      \"missed\": \"低音追赶、右手挣扎和细碎音符对应急促脚步、混乱心跳的具体画面；脑中停不下来的反事实假设，需要逐句读才能理解。底部动画虽然醒目，但不能直接看出这些情绪含义。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他重新想起曾经很好的亲近时光，却发现美好的回忆反而让当初的委屈和对另一种人生的设想更加难以放下。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、委屈、遗憾、反复纠结\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的先前温暖没有带来安稳、恰恰因为记忆太好才更难受这一层解释，虽然重要，但字号较小，容易一眼略过；下方音乐与反复假设之间的对应关系也需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"大字已经把怀念过去、旧委屈翻涌、反复追问当初选择这条主线交代得比较清楚，主要问题是连接情绪与音乐画面的关键内容都放在底部较小的文字里。急促脚步、乱拍心跳、低音追赶、脑中反复假设这些内容，扫一眼不容易抓到；下半屏的金色音符动画本身又比较抽象，无法独立呈现人物的焦躁和纠结。因此人物的怀念与后悔能连起来，但音乐画面与人物处境之间还缺少一眼就能建立的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ec303662-acab-435d-8adc-6f35a80d5de4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001039837754Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:11:35.868355+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb8ca6ba2cdd353bad83e559385692444d766bb6e2894a27f449a13da8c6aed9", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001039837754Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "28f09689e62e83e84c8de7beeba85cef99a610957fc4cc6a2a23a0a3540de8c7"}}}
